WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:08.870 align:start position:0%
 
it was the day  england fans had waited 55 years for  what's going on  but what should have been a day to  cherish quickly descended into violence  and chaos  wembley stadium was due to be at 75  capacity  sky news estimates that the number of  people who came to wembley  was in the region of 150 000 more than  double its capacity  we've analyzed exactly what happened and  when at the euro 2020 final  it's early afternoon ticket holders and  fans keen to soak up the atmosphere are  starting to arrive on wembley way  hours before the game is due to start  it's getting more and more crowded and  it's clear  thousands of people are arriving without  tickets  for those with tickets there are four  entrances where covert checks and  screenings are taking place  these lead to level one the outer ring  of the stadium  at 5 25 pm the first in a series of  security breaches takes place at one of  the four  entrances at the top of the spanish  steps legitimate ticket holders are  caught up in the crush as the stewards  are overwhelmed  along with at least six police officers  that we have counted in this and other  videos of the scene  shortly after in this video one steward  tries to hold one of the external fences  in place  but there are too many people pushing  through he and his two other colleagues  are quickly overwhelmed  [Music]  we counted at least 50 fans breaking  through running towards the club wembley  entrance  this video filmed from another angle  filmed at 5  37 p.m shows that area with dozens of  people making it into the stadium  grounds  they run up these stairs to level one  where the main axis points directly into  the stadium are  less than 100 meters away on the north  east side of the stadium  oh no a group knocks down a barrier  two mounted police officers move in to  stop others from entering  but there are easier routes for others  at 6 11 pm  at least 10 people climb onto a  temporary toilet block on the south side  by now large numbers of ticklish fans  are inside the grounds  along with others who have paid to be  there and some are about to breach the  inner ring  which leads directly to the seating area  overlooking the pitch  a large crowd attempts to enter at  entrance point g  [Music]  in the first 15 seconds of this clip we  counted at least  50 people entering the stadium  at 7 20 p.m a group attempts to rush a  disabled entrance on the south  east side of the ground a number are  successful  as they overwhelm the four stewards  trying to hold them back  we found two videos of this moment some  other fans already inside attempt to  block  and fight those streaming in the  stewards are overrun  multiple times by the huge numbers  trying to get inside  with minutes to go until kickoff some  fans can be seen pushing out  what appears to be a ticklish fan from  the seating area  [Music]  [Applause]  by the end of the day many fans were  attacked  had their seats taken and were subjected  to abuse  these security breaches led uefa to open  disciplinary proceedings against cfa  they've also dealt a huge blow for the  uk irish bid to host the 2030 world cup  what was supposed to be the dream ending  for many  became a nightmare

